      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notes.jsx (state owner)\n• notes[] = { id, text, embedding }  ← Local Storage\n• mergeCandidate state → MergeModal.jsx (new)\n\nsaveHandler() triggers:\n1. POST /api/embed (new note text)\n2. cosine-similarity search vs. notes[].embedding\n   (done in-browser — vectors already in Local Storage)\n3. if match(es) ≥ threshold → POST /api/merge",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 160,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notes.jsx (state owner)\n• notes[] = { id, text, embedding }  ← Local Storage\n• mergeCandidate state → MergeModal.jsx (new)\n\nsaveHandler() triggers:\n1. POST /api/embed (new note text)\n2. cosine-similarity search vs. notes[].embedding\n   (done in-browser — vectors already in Local Storage)\n3. if match(es) ≥ threshold → POST /api/merge",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3",
      "autoResize": true
    },
