      "text": "- No dedicated vector DB.\n- Embeddings stored inline on each\nnote object in Local Storage\n- same persistence layer as\neverything else in Fleetr.\n\nSimilarity search = brute-force\ncosine similarity in the browser.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 140,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- No dedicated vector DB.\n- Embeddings stored inline on each\nnote object in Local Storage\n- same persistence layer as\neverything else in Fleetr.\n\nSimilarity search = brute-force\ncosine similarity in the browser.",
